<div class="page-heading"><div><h1>Good to see you, <%= @client.name %>.</h1><p>A little reflection, at your pace.</p></div></div>
<p class="small muted"><%= @client.email %></p>
<div class="home-cards">
  <section class="card bg-base-100 home-card">
    <span class="home-icon" aria-hidden="true">✎</span>
    <h2>My journal</h2><p>Make a little space to reflect on meals, movement, and your day.</p>
    <%= link_to "My journal", journal_entries_path, class: "btn btn-outline" %>
  </section>
  <section class="card bg-base-100 home-card">
    <span class="home-icon" aria-hidden="true">♡</span>
    <h2>My providers</h2><p>View your providers and choose who can read your journal.</p>
    <%= link_to "My providers", enrollments_path, class: "btn btn-outline" %>
  </section>
</div>
<section class="hello-note"><h2>Your day doesn’t need a perfect summary.</h2><p>Your journal is a place for everyday reflection. Your current providers can read your entries to better understand your day.</p></section>
